MODIFICATIONS
-------------
This is a modified version (fork) of the original Error Monitoring Platform
by the Monitoring Team:

    https://github.com/krionefishy/monitoring

whose last upstream revision incorporated here is dated 2026-05-31.

Modified by Artamonov Arkadii, starting 2026-07-27. Changes include, among
others: migration to uv and Python 3.13+, a monorepo layout with an editable
monitor-service package, a reworked SDK (DSN validation, service_name support,
module-based error signatures, configurable traceback trimming, thread and
asyncio exception hooks, capture_message), a queue-and-worker delivery model,
and a web UI at /ui.

The full change history is available in the Git history of this repository.

